  "sections": {
    "starterStories": {
      "body": "The current source configuration assigns the Fremen starter pool to SoA_Fremen, SoA_FremenFighter, SoA_FremenScout, SoA_FremenFedaykin, and SoA_FremenNaib. Its childhood stories are sietch child (SoA_Bio_Fremen_TribeChild40), rock-shelter apprentice (SoA_Bio_Fremen_CaveChild30), and hearth apprentice (SoA_Bio_Fremen_FireKeeper44); adult stories are sietch cook (SoA_Bio_Fremen_StewKeeper95), sietch builder (SoA_Bio_Fremen_Framer37), and desert hunter (SoA_Bio_Fremen_Hunter74). The 18 authored stories retain their selected Core template mechanics; this pool changes which stories newly generated owned pawns may draw from, not their skill rules. The category patch does not migrate biographies already stored in saves. This is a bounded starter pool, not a claim that every pawn of this culture uses these stories."
    }
  },
